# ask_to_use_workshop — not offered to a body with no trade there
#
# Without a crafting modus mentis that works a station of the smithy, nobody has a reason to ask for it:
# the verb is withheld, and the pinned goal falls back to another.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Forge" --period dawn --observe-only blacksmith

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

allow-flag-miss --goal-only
strategy succeed
goal ask_to_use_workshop
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-no-verb ask_to_use_workshop
quit
